{"id":82743,"date":"2024-04-03T02:42:45","date_gmt":"2024-04-03T08:42:45","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/?page_id=82743"},"modified":"2024-11-12T02:42:00","modified_gmt":"2024-11-12T09:42:00","slug":"how-kiierr-laser-cap-technology-works","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/how-kiierr-laser-cap-technology-works\/","title":{"rendered":"how kiierr laser cap technology works"},"content":{"rendered":"\n\t<section class=\"section\" id=\"section_355438170\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section-bg fill\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"section-content relative\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"row row-collapse\"  id=\"row-1098612633\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1585500912\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-1794333765\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<h1 class=\"thin-font\"><strong>How do Kiierr laser caps <\/strong><em>work?<\/em><\/h1>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-1794333765 {\n  text-align: center;\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-1794333765 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\n<style>\n#section_355438170 {\n  padding-top: 30px;\n  padding-bottom: 30px;\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/section>\n\t\n\n\t<section class=\"section\" id=\"section_2104962275\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section-bg fill\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"section-content relative\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"row row-collapse\"  id=\"row-1564460948\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1382231511\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-1066413444\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<h1 class=\"thin-font\"><strong>Day 1 <\/strong> <em>Begin Treatment<\/em>?<\/h1>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-1066413444 {\n  text-align: center;\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-1066413444 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\n<style>\n#section_2104962275 {\n  padding-top: 30px;\n  padding-bottom: 30px;\n  background-color: rgb(237, 229, 221);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/section>\n\t\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-640004213\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1617909358\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"row align-middle\"  id=\"row-318059970\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-43456931\" class=\"col medium-6 small-12 large-6\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_1740456815\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner dark\" >\n\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1196\" height=\"1182\" src=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/5-1.png\" class=\"attachment-original size-original\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/5-1.png 1196w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/5-1-300x296.png 300w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/5-1-1024x1012.png 1024w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/5-1-768x759.png 768w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/5-1-800x791.png 800w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/5-1-100x100.png 100w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1196px) 100vw, 1196px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<style>\n#image_1740456815 {\n  width: 100%;\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1526849596\" class=\"col medium-6 small-12 large-6\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-3307262678\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>When using your <strong>Kiierr laser cap<\/strong>, start by ensuring your hair is clean and dry. Place the cap securely on your head and press the power button to activate the low-level laser therapy. Depending on the model, the treatment time will either be 30 minutes every other day or 6 minutes daily. The cap will automatically turn off after the session.<\/p>\n<p>For optimal results, <strong>be consistent with your treatment schedule.<\/strong> It may take several weeks to notice any changes, but with regular use, you\u2019ll start seeing improvements in hair thickness and growth. Patience is key, as hair regrowth takes time!<\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-3307262678 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-3307262678 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-891888265\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-706978960\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner text-center\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n<a class=\"button primary lowercase dfsetre\"  style=\"border-radius:99px;\">\n\t\t<span>GET YOURS TODAY<\/span>\n\t<i class=\"icon-angle-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\" ><\/i><\/a>\n\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n\n\t<section class=\"section\" id=\"section_274133956\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section-bg fill\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"section-content relative\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"row row-collapse\"  id=\"row-1600377049\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-460563624\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-1276483683\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<h1 class=\"thin-font\"><strong>Day 30-90 <\/strong> <em>Hair Loss Stops<\/em>?<\/h1>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-1276483683 {\n  text-align: center;\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-1276483683 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\n<style>\n#section_274133956 {\n  padding-top: 30px;\n  padding-bottom: 30px;\n  background-color: rgb(237, 229, 221);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/section>\n\t\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-1203052191\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1756617318\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"row align-middle\"  id=\"row-1865768556\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-948915804\" class=\"col medium-6 small-12 large-6\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-2593892721\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>During days 30-90 of using your Kiierr laser cap, you may begin to notice a <strong>reduction in hair shedding<\/strong>. This is a positive sign that the treatment is working. As the laser therapy stimulates your hair follicles, it helps to shift them from the shedding phase to the growth phase. While hair regrowth might not be visible yet, you\u2019re likely to see less hair falling out during this stage.<\/p>\n<p>At this point, consistency is still crucial. While results may vary, many users experience less thinning and improved hair density as they move through this stage. Stay patient, as <strong>visible regrowth typically occurs after 2-3 months of consistent use.<\/strong><\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-2593892721 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-2593892721 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n\n\t<div id=\"col-915090620\" class=\"col medium-6 small-12 large-6\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_1209076544\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner dark\" >\n\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1304\" height=\"1196\" src=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/7.png\" class=\"attachment-original size-original\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/7.png 1304w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/7-300x275.png 300w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/7-1024x939.png 1024w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/7-768x704.png 768w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/7-800x734.png 800w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1304px) 100vw, 1304px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<style>\n#image_1209076544 {\n  width: 100%;\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n\n\t<section class=\"section\" id=\"section_917300979\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section-bg fill\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"section-content relative\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"row row-collapse\"  id=\"row-1750893859\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1858966167\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-687042041\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<h1 class=\"thin-font\"><strong>Day 90-180 <\/strong> <em>Hair Regrowth Starts<\/em>?<\/h1>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-687042041 {\n  text-align: center;\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-687042041 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\n<style>\n#section_917300979 {\n  padding-top: 30px;\n  padding-bottom: 30px;\n  background-color: rgb(237, 229, 221);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/section>\n\t\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-2139793216\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1938493583\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"row align-middle\"  id=\"row-372453982\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1471667944\" class=\"col medium-6 small-12 large-6\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_1047169769\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner dark\" >\n\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1196\" height=\"1196\" src=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/6-1.png\" class=\"attachment-original size-original\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/6-1.png 1196w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/6-1-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/6-1-1024x1024.png 1024w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/6-1-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/6-1-768x768.png 768w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/6-1-800x800.png 800w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/6-1-100x100.png 100w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1196px) 100vw, 1196px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<style>\n#image_1047169769 {\n  width: 100%;\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1553373345\" class=\"col medium-6 small-12 large-6\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-3625815001\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>From days 90 to 180, you\u2019ll likely start to see <strong>visible signs of hair growth<\/strong>. During this stage, the low-level laser therapy has stimulated the hair follicles enough to promote new hair growth. You may notice tiny, fine hairs emerging in areas where hair thinning was previously more noticeable. This is a great indication that your treatment is having an effect.<\/p>\n<p>Keep in mind that hair growth can vary from person to person, and it may take time for these new hairs to become thicker and more noticeable. Continue your treatments as directed, and <strong>by the end of this stage, you should start seeing a fuller, thicker hairline.<\/strong><\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-3625815001 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-3625815001 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n\n\t<section class=\"section\" id=\"section_809677447\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section-bg fill\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"section-content relative\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"row row-collapse\"  id=\"row-864257984\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-872371292\" class=\"col small-1